<!-- ============================ SOLAR SYSTEMS ============================= -->
<section class="wrap">
  <div class="page-head tight">
    <p class="kicker">Second Subject</p>
    <h2 id="t-solar-systems-ours-and-the-others">Solar Systems, Ours and the Others</h2>
    <p class="lede muted">For the whole of human history we had one example. Since 1995 we have had nearly
    six thousand, and almost nothing about our own arrangement turns out to be typical.</p>
  </div>

  <figure id="fig-system" class="plate">
