    <h2 id="t-galaxies-and-what-they-are-made-of">Galaxies, and What They Are Made Of</h2>
    <p class="lede muted">A hundred years ago it was an open question whether anything existed outside the
    Milky Way. The answer arrived in 1924 and was the largest single expansion of the known world in the
    history of the species.</p>
  </div>

