<section class="wrap narrow reveal">
  <div class="frame frame--creed">
    <p class="kicker">A Closing Stance</p>
    <p>The sky is the one place where the order's rule on evidence costs nothing and gains everything. There
    is no need to embellish a universe that contains a star spinning 716 times a second, a hole the size of
    a solar system photographed by a telescope the size of the Earth, and a number of galaxies that nobody
    can write down honestly without saying "about".</p>
    <p>Wonder does not require the claims to be loose. It requires looking up often, and for long enough
    that the slow things become visible. Test everything kindly.</p>
  </div>
</section>

